未来を今超えよう
Let's surpass the future right now!

137
00:19:02,558 --> 00:19:03,858
Yeah!

138
00:19:03,958 --> 00:19:05,358
絶対！
Absolutely!

139
00:19:05,758 --> 00:19:07,558
大胆！
Bold!

140
00:19:08,858 --> 00:19:14,058
Yeah! 最大！ 大胆！
Yeah! Maximum! Bold!

141
00:19:14,658 --> 00:19:20,658
こんな困難だって 案外平気だし
Even difficulties like this are surprisingly okay,

142
00:19:20,858 --> 00:19:26,958
DOKI DOKI しながらまたハマってく
