てゆーか「待ってるのはラクだけじゃない」こと
I mean, I'm starting to realize that waiting around isn't the only easy thing...

144
00:19:33,558 --> 00:19:39,858
わかり始めているから Don't lose my way!
That's why I'm starting to understand... Don't lose my way!

145
00:19:40,458 --> 00:19:46,558
傷付くのも恐れないで どこにでも行ける
Without fearing getting hurt, I can go anywhere!

146
00:19:46,758 --> 00:19:53,658
絶対可憐！それがポリシー！ 痛みも楽しめる
Absolutely lovely! That's my policy! I can even enjoy the pain.

147
00:19:54,458 --> 00:20:00,558
涙は夢のありかを探す輝き
Tears are the brilliance that searches for the whereabouts of dreams!

148
00:20:02,304 --> 00:20:06,184
それぞれ違う光を放つ
