00:21:30,764 --> 00:21:36,344
[Text: 作詞: Satoshi Yaginuma・yuki-ka
作曲: Satoshi Yaginuma]
[Text: Lyrics: Satoshi Yaginuma & yuki-ka
Music: Satoshi Yaginuma]

158
00:21:42,945 --> 00:21:49,265
放て！心に刻んだ夢を 未来さえ置き去りにして
Unleash the dream carved in your heart, leaving even the future behind!

159
00:21:49,645 --> 00:21:52,085
限界など知らない 意味無い！
Knowing no limits, it's meaningless!

160
00:21:53,025 --> 00:22:01,505
この力が光散らす その先に遥かな想いを
Scatter the light with this power, carrying distant feelings far beyond.

161
00:22:04,025 --> 00:22:09,785
歩いてきた この道を 振り返ることしか
If all we can do is look back...

162
00:22:10,285 --> 00:22:16,565
出来ないなら…今ここで全てを壊せる
