172
00:23:25,925 --> 00:23:32,225
打ち出した答えが今日も 私の胸を駆け巡る
The answer we struck out races through my chest again today.

173
00:23:33,645 --> 00:23:39,385
Sparkling! The shiny lights awake true desire. Only my railgun can shoot it. 必ず
Sparkling! The shiny lights awake true desire. Only my railgun can shoot it, absolutely!

174
00:23:40,145 --> 00:23:46,165
貫いてく 迷うことなく 傷ついても 走り続ける
Piercing through without hesitation, I'll keep running even if I get hurt.

175
